# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The camera used the way a hand uses it: the rear camera opens and settles,
# the front is tapped in, a front photograph is taken, and the rear is tapped
# back in. The second rear session is the one that used to come back soft --
# its search found no peak in the travel and stopped at whichever position the
# noise made look sharpest -- so this scene is the one that says whether the
# flat travel now goes back to the position the first session settled on.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 10 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6 tap 0.845 0.36 wait 22 tap 0.352 0.067 wait 4 tap 0.886 0.871 wait 16 tap 0.5 0.86 wait 12 tap 0.886 0.871 wait 26
